#3102
A Dirt Road through the Forest~
   The forest crowds in around you, as if eager to reclaim the path you travel
upon. In some places, the brush is so thick that you are forced to hack your
way through. In one such section, your efforts reveal a decrepit building just
to your southwest. The remnants of the path extend to the south and west.
