#3103
Before a Pagan Altar~
   This shrine has surely seen better days. The roof has collapsed, and leaves
are piled in several places. The door is ripped from its hinges, creaking
eerily with the wind. Something about the altar nags at you, though. The forest
lies through the doorway to the east.
~
